---
import './shadow-split-s5.css';
const zh = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/zh-cn/');
---

<section
  id="shadow-split-s5"
  class="s5"
  data-shadow-s5
  data-lang={zh ? 'zh' : 'en'}
  aria-label="Shadow split S5"
>
  <h2>Shadow split · S5</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh
        ? '原生文本输入：Base Input、Base Textarea、Shadcn Textarea 与 Tabs。Light / split / mixed；仍为 draft。'
        : 'Native text editing: Base Input, Base Textarea, Shadcn Textarea and Tabs. Light / split / mixed; still draft.'
    }
  </p>
  <div data-s5-app></div>
  <details>
    <summary>{zh ? '人工验收目标与边界' : 'Manual targets and boundaries'}</summary>
    <ol>
      <li>
        {
          zh
            ? '输入、选择、方向键移动光标和中文 IME；重点比较候选阶段、提交和取消。自动 composition 测试不能代替真实系统 IME。'
            : 'Type, select, move the caret and use a real IME; compare candidates, commit and cancellation. Synthetic composition tests do not replace platform IME acceptance.'
        }
      </li>
      <li>
        {
          zh
            ? 'Input 与 Shadcn Textarea 为受控值；启用拒绝受控提案后，编辑提案不被接受。Base Textarea 为非受控值，无关 props 更新不得覆盖已输入内容。'
            : 'Input and Shadcn Textarea are controlled; rejected proposals restore the accepted value. Base Textarea is uncontrolled; unrelated props updates must retain edits.'
        }
      </li>
      <li>
        {
          zh
            ? '比较鼠标和键盘 focus ring、disabled/readOnly、rows 及主题。surface customization 应只改变原生 editor，撤销后恢复。'
            : 'Compare pointer/keyboard focus rings, disabled/readOnly, rows and theme. Surface customization targets only the native editor and is reversible.'
        }
      </li>
      <li>
        {
          zh
            ? '反复切换 Tabs 和 keepMounted，观察 view 计数和模型；移除重连会新建实例。受控值由 Maker 保留，非受控值在终止实例后重置是预期行为。'
            : 'Repeat Tabs/keepMounted changes and inspect view counts and models. Reconnection creates new instances; the Maker retains controlled values while terminal teardown resets uncontrolled state.'
        }
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p>
      {
        zh
          ? '混合列包含 Light Input/Tabs Root/List/Trigger 与 split Textarea/Content。原生 editor 本身是 part="control surface"，没有额外视觉 div；Base 原生外观刻意保留。仅使用正式 CLI companion，撤销网站 reset，不补算尺寸。跨 Shadow 的外部 labelledBy/describedBy IDREF、Form、auto-resize、Image View 及 Dialog #645 不属于本次验收保证。'
          : 'Mixed combines Light Input/Tabs Root/List/Trigger with split Textarea/Content. The editor itself is part="control surface", without a visual div; Base keeps native appearance. Uses the real CLI companion and withdraws site reset without sizing patches. External cross-Shadow labelledBy/describedBy IDREFs, Form, auto-resize, Image View and Dialog #645 are outside this acceptance guarantee.'
      }
    </p>
  </details>
</section>
<script>
  import { mountShadowSplitS5 } from './shadow-split-s5';
  const initialize = () =>
    document
      .querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-shadow-s5]')
      .forEach((el) => mountShadowSplitS5(el));
  initialize();
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initialize);
</script>
